    "about": "<h3>I wasn\u2019t handed anything. I built myself through hardship, hard work, and relentless drive. Every obstacle taught me something\u2014and I turned those lessons into a tool that helps others leave a lasting impression in seconds.</h3><h3><strong>vBiz Me</strong>&nbsp;is more than a digital card. It\u2019s a first-impression machine. A conversion tool. A way to stand out and get remembered.</h3><h3>\ud83d\udd39 Visionary &amp; Builder \u2013 I create solutions that break the mold</h3><h3>\ud83d\udd39 Sales &amp; Marketing Strategist \u2013 I turn attention into action</h3><h3>\ud83d\udd39 Empowerment Coach \u2013 I help people level up, fast</h3><h3>\ud83d\udd39 Founder \u2013 Leading with purpose, not just profit</h3><h3>Your brand deserves more than a paper card.</h3><h3><strong>Let\u2019s make it unforgettable.</strong></h3><h3><strong>Impressions That Last \u2013 Connections That Matter.</strong></h3>",
